# Project Context Ledger (.agent)

Last updated: 2026-08-09 (baseline agent context system)
Repository: C:\Users\Hp\Documents\personal\event management
Default branch: main

## Purpose
This file is the persistent project context for AI-assisted chats.
It is the single source of truth for:
- current architecture
- important conventions
- active runtime/dev state
- recent changes and reasoning

Every meaningful change to the codebase must also update this file.

## Current Runtime / Workspace State
- Full-stack Laravel + React SPA (Inertia-style Blade shell + Vite React app)
- Dev: `composer run dev` (Unix) or `composer run dev:windows` (Windows)
  - Laravel serve: `http://localhost:8000` (Unix) / `http://localhost:8002` (Windows script)
  - Vite HMR via `npm run dev` / `pnpm` Vite
  - Queue worker: `php artisan queue:listen`
- API base: `http://localhost:8000/api/v1` (or `:8002` on Windows `dev:windows`)
- Health: `GET /up`; API ping: `GET /api/ping`
- Known gotchas:
  - Windows uses `composer run dev:windows` (no Pail/pcntl); port **8002** not 8000
  - Frontend package lock is **pnpm** (`pnpm-lock.yaml`); npm also documented
  - Queue/cache/session default to **database** drivers — migrate before first run
  - Do not commit `.env` or secrets

## Tech Stack
### Backend
- PHP 8.2+, Laravel 12
- Auth: Laravel Sanctum (Bearer tokens)
- RBAC: spatie/laravel-permission
- Audit: spatie/laravel-activitylog
- Location: stevebauman/location
- Queue jobs (e.g. `SendEmailJob`), Mail via queued `MailService`

### Frontend
- React 18 + TypeScript, Vite 5, `laravel-vite-plugin`
- Redux Toolkit + TanStack React Query
- React Router DOM 6
- UI: Tailwind CSS 3, MUI, Mantine, Headless UI
- Forms: React Hook Form / Formik; Yup / Zod
- i18n: i18next (`public/locales/{en,ae}/translation.json`)

### Build / Tooling
- Composer (PHP), pnpm/npm (Node)
- PHPUnit 11 (`composer test` / `php artisan test`)
- Laravel Pint; Vite (`npm run dev|build|preview`)
- Config entrypoints: `vite.config.js`, `tailwind.config.cjs`, `postcss.config.cjs`, `tsconfig.json`, `phpunit.xml`

## Run Commands
- Install: `composer install`; `pnpm install` (or `npm install`)
- Env: copy `.env.example` → `.env`; `php artisan key:generate`; configure DB; `php artisan migrate`; `php artisan db:seed`
- Primary dev: `composer run dev` or `composer run dev:windows`
- Manual: `php artisan serve` + `php artisan queue:work` + `npm run dev`
- Frontend only: `npm run dev` / `npm run build`
- Tests: `composer test` or `php artisan test`
- Agent hook (once after clone): `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\install-agent-hook.ps1`

## High-Level Architecture
- Browser loads Blade (`resources/views/app.blade.php`) → Vite React app (`resources/js/src`)
- SPA calls REST API under `/api/v1/*`
- Auth: Sanctum personal access tokens; middleware `auth:sanctum`; Spatie `role` / `permission` aliases in `bootstrap/app.php`
- API always JSON via `EnsureJsonResponse` prepended on `api` stack
- Versioned route files: `routes/api.php` → `routes/api/v1/{auth,users,roles,settings,logs,organizations}.php`
- Controllers: `app/Http/Controllers/Api/*`; shared traits `ApiResponseTrait`, `ApiFilterTrait`
- Services: `MailService`, `LocationService`, `CommonServices`
- Domain models: `User`, `Role`, `Organization`, `Settings` (+ Spatie permission/activity tables)

## Backend Structure Notes
- `app/Http/Controllers/Api/` — Auth, User, Role, Organization, Settings, Log, BaseController
- `app/Enums/` — `UserType`, `UserStatus`
- `app/Jobs/SendEmailJob.php`, `app/Console/Commands/StartQueueWorker.php`
- `database/migrations` — users, permissions, activity_log, settings, organizations, tokens, jobs/cache
- Seeders: `DatabaseSeeder`, `RolePermissionSeeder`, `SettingsSeeder`

## Frontend Structure Notes
- Entry: `resources/js/src/main.tsx`, `App.tsx`
- Routing: `resources/js/src/router/`
- Pages: dashboard, user, organization, logs, login, profile, search, lock-screen, settings-related layouts
- API clients: `resources/js/src/services/` (`baseApi`, auth, user, role, organization, logs, mail, …)
- State: `store/` (auth, organization, theme); contexts for organization/modal
- Shared UI: `components/` (datatable, forms, upload, BulkCreateForm, etc.), `layouts/`

## Data + Domain Conventions
- Multi-org: `Organization` model + frontend `OrganizationContext` / `organizationSlice`
- Users have typed status/type enums; soft deletes on roles
- Permissions seeded via Spatie; frontend `usePermission`
- API responses go through controller/trait JSON helpers
- Activity log for audit; email templates under `resources/views/mail/`

## Known Risks / Watchouts
- Thin automated test coverage under `tests/`
- Keep Sanctum/CORS/SSL and raw-query usage reviewed on security-sensitive changes
- Large static asset tree under `public/assets/` — avoid unrelated churn
- Path-gate: critical edits require staging an updated `.agent` (see Automated Enforcement)

## Update Protocol (Mandatory)

When any future chat changes code, this `.agent` file must be updated in the same work session.

### Minimum Required Updates Per Change
1. Update `Last updated` date + short summary.
2. Append a Change Log entry with:
   - date
   - short title
   - files touched
   - behavior change
   - migration/config/env impact
   - verification performed
3. If architecture/routes/modules/permissions/data model changed, update the matching sections above.

### Keep In Sync Rule
- If code and `.agent` disagree, `.agent` is stale and must be fixed immediately.
- No feature / refactor / bugfix is complete until `.agent` reflects the new state.

### Automated Enforcement
- Local pre-commit hook: `.git/hooks/pre-commit` runs `check-agent-update.sh`
- Guard script: `check-agent-update.sh`
- Installer: `install-agent-hook.ps1`
- CI gate: `.github/workflows/agent-context-check.yml`
- Rule: if staged/pushed changes touch critical project paths and `.agent` is not included, fail.

